{"id":"n45156-2-8","stage":5,"title":"깃발 · 旗号","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n45156-2-8-1","ko":"독재 정권이 드디어 무너졌군요.","zh":"独裁政权终于垮台了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"독재","meaning":"专政，专治，独裁","explanation":"독재：专政，专治，独裁","readings":[{"term":"독재","audio":"/audio/d079430841c2034f429f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48507","senseId":"2","lemma":"독재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정권이","meaning":"政权","explanation":"정권：政权；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정권","audio":"/audio/991e6f6ecb1fc06e6337.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74986","senseId":"1","lemma":"정권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무너졌군요.","meaning":"跨台","explanation":"무너지다：跨台；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"무너지다","audio":"/audio/97dcdfb77be61ad9d19b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15517","senseId":"4","lemma":"무너지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d079430841c2034f","term":"독재","zh":"专政，专治，独裁","audio":"/audio/d079430841c2034f429f.mp3","entryId":"48507","definition":"一个人完全占有一个国家的权利，自己随心所欲的政治。","pronunciation":["독째"]},{"id":"991e6f6ecb1fc06e","term":"정권","zh":"政权","audio":"/audio/991e6f6ecb1fc06e6337.mp3","entryId":"74986","definition":"负责实行政治的权力。","pronunciation":["정꿘"]},{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"97dcdfb77be61ad9","term":"무너지다","zh":"跨台","audio":"/audio/97dcdfb77be61ad9d19b.mp3","entryId":"15517","definition":"权力消失或国家灭亡。","pronunciation":["무너지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd0f48b42259f8e293b0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n45156-2-8-2","ko":"민주주의의 깃발 아래 뭉친 세력의 승리죠.","zh":"这可是在民主主义的旗帜下团结起来的各方力量取得的胜利啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민주주의의","meaning":"民主主义","explanation":"민주주의：民主主义；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"민주주의","audio":"/audio/93b109f563829083d686.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15777","senseId":"1","lemma":"민주주의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깃발","meaning":"旗号","explanation":"깃발：旗号","readings":[{"term":"깃발","audio":"/audio/58846146fd0f2e4476fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45156","senseId":"2","lemma":"깃발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아래","meaning":"下","explanation":"아래：下","readings":[{"term":"아래","audio":"/audio/8f2ea9820639f8b85047.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71288","senseId":"3","lemma":"아래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭉친","meaning":"抱团，团结","explanation":"뭉치다：抱团，团结；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뭉치다","audio":"/audio/dc62c7a03a43ccba94a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57121","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭉치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세력의","meaning":"势力","explanation":"세력：势力；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"세력","audio":"/audio/546717f9b7520eeb2616.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64348","senseId":"2","lemma":"세력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승리죠.","meaning":"胜利，取胜","explanation":"승리：胜利，取胜；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"승리","audio":"/audio/a951ee69c9839f78ee19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15946","senseId":"1","lemma":"승리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"93b109f563829083","term":"민주주의","zh":"民主主义","audio":"/audio/93b109f563829083d686.mp3","entryId":"15777","definition":"认为主权在民，主张实施以民为本的政治的思想。","pronunciation":["민주주의","민주주이"]},{"id":"58846146fd0f2e44","term":"깃발","zh":"旗号","audio":"/audio/58846146fd0f2e4476fa.mp3","entryId":"45156","definition":"明确地提出某种思想或目的的态度或主张。","pronunciation":["기빨","긷빨"]},{"id":"8f2ea9820639f8b8","term":"아래","zh":"下","audio":"/audio/8f2ea9820639f8b85047.mp3","entryId":"71288",